  "h1": [
   "Photography Is Poetry."
  ],
  "allText": "ABOUT ME\nPHOTOGRAPHY IS POETRY.\nI'm a photographer based in Gauteng, drawn to the raw, unfiltered beauty of real people and unfiltered moments. For me, photography isn't just about what you see — it's about what you feel.\nI believe the best images aren't staged. They happen. They live in the in-between, in the quiet looks, the laughter, the chaos, the stillness.\nThis is my way of telling your story — honestly, creatively, and with intention.\nLET'S CREATE TOGETHER"
 },
